{*
    The template half of a view, standing alone.

    This fixture's presenter has no renderDefault(), so the only thing that
    makes `default` a page of it is this file - which is what proves the rule
    reads templates as well as methods. A rule that read methods alone would
    call this presenter a presenter with no views and report nothing about it.
*}
<p>A page of the administration that nobody declared anything about.</p>
